<title>UK: Telkom at $34.625 in London at 0915 GMT.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $34.625 in London at 0915 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telkom traded at $34.625 and London at 0915 GMT on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of $34.625 and the day's high of $34.75.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Tuesday $34.625. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
